  "headline": "Turkish authorities search for suspected lioness on the loose in Istanbul woodland",
  "label": "NEWS",
  "caption": "A big cat on the loose has authorities on high alert in Turkey. 🦁\n\nTurkish authorities are searching for an animal resembling a lion in a woodland area on the outskirts of Istanbul, according to Reuters and AP News.\n\n Anadolu reports that Istanbul authorities have closed a recreational woodland as the capture operation expands.\n\nTeams are actively working to locate and capture the suspected lioness safely while the operation continues, according to TRT World.\n\nHave you ever encountered a wild animal in your city before?\n\nFollow Vok for more stories like this.\n#Vok #VokOriginals #Istanbul #Turkey #Wildlife\n\n📸 Spc. Chuck Gill / Wikimedia Commons (Public domain)",
